    "quote": "In return, NVIDIA will receive a percentage of these cloud providers’ revenue, with the revenue-sharing rate gradually declining over the term of the contract.",
    "one_line": "The report said NVIDIA would receive a declining percentage of participating cloud providers’ revenue over the contract term.",
    "speaker": "The Information, as reported by moomoo.com",
    "original_who": "The Information",
    "original_day": "2026-07-01",
    "tier": "rumour"
   },
   {
    "id": "e3",
    "quote": "GPU cloud providers Firmus and Sharon AI have already joined the program, and three executives with existing business ties to NVIDIA confirmed the arrangement.",
    "one_line": "Firmus and Sharon AI had joined NVIDIA’s program, and three executives with existing NVIDIA business ties confirmed the arrangement.",
    "speaker": "The Information, as reported by moomoo.com",
    "original_who": "The Information",
    "original_day": "2026-07-01",
    "tier": "rumour"
   },
   {
    "id": "e4",
    "quote": "On July 1, NVIDIA published a statement on its official website announcing a new business model that combines revenue sharing with credit support, enabling AI cloud providers to procure NVIDIA infrastructure without bearing the full upfront capital expenditure, and allowing them to offer computing services to downstream AI-native enterprises, model developers, and corporate clients.",
    "one_line": "On 2026-07-01, NVIDIA announced a business model combining revenue sharing and credit support for AI cloud providers procuring NVIDIA infrastructure.",
    "speaker": "NVIDIA",
    "original_who": "NVIDIA",
    "original_day": "2026-07-01",
    "tier": "fact"
   },
   {
    "id": "e5",
    "quote": "Sharon AI plans to deploy up to 40,000 NVIDIA Grace Blackwell GB300 GPUs, while Firmus is constructing a DSX AI Factory campus in Batam, Indonesia, expected to scale up to 360 megawatts and accommodate up to 170,000 NVIDIA GPUs.",
    "one_line": "Sharon AI planned to deploy up to 40,000 NVIDIA Grace Blackwell GB300 GPUs; Firmus was constructing a Batam DSX AI Factory campus expected to reach up to 360 MW and accommodate up to 170,000 NVIDIA GPUs.",
    "speaker": "moomoo.com",
    "original_who": "",
    "original_day": "",
    "tier": "third_party_view"
   },
   {
    "id": "e6",
    "quote": "A data center executive commented on such NVIDIA deals as “killing two birds with one stone.” He explained that if NVIDIA merely provided a guarantee for a data center facility lease, “you’d still face the question of ‘how to finance the GPUs’”; but if NVIDIA commits to purchasing any unsold compute capacity within the facility, “the GPU financing issue is resolved—and so is the data center’s financing problem.”",
    "one_line": "An unnamed data center executive said that NVIDIA’s commitment to purchase unsold compute capacity could address both GPU financing and data-center financing problems.",
    "speaker": "An unnamed data center executive, quoted by moomoo.com",
    "original_who": "",
    "original_day": "",
    "tier": "third_party_view"
   },
   {
    "id": "e7",
    "quote": "According to prior reporting by The Information, NVIDIA has also recently been negotiating to provide financial guarantees for OpenAI’s lease of a large data center in Ohio—an asset that, if fully built out at current prices for chips, labor, power, and other materials, could cost as much as $500 billion.",
    "one_line": "The Information had reported that NVIDIA was negotiating to guarantee OpenAI’s lease of a large Ohio data center, whose fully built-out cost could reach $500 billion at then-current input prices.",
    "speaker": "The Information, as reported by moomoo.com",
    "original_who": "The Information",
    "original_day": "",
    "tier": "rumour"
   },
   {
    "id": "e8",
    "quote": "To date, NVIDIA has invested several billion dollars in equity stakes in multiple emerging cloud service providers and, in certain cases, agreed to lease back chips from these companies—including CoreWeave and Lambda—in transactions totaling several billion dollars.",
    "one_line": "The report said NVIDIA had invested several billion dollars in equity stakes in multiple emerging cloud providers and had agreed to lease back chips from providers including CoreWeave and Lambda in transactions totaling several billion dollars.",
    "speaker": "moomoo.com, citing prior reporting by The Information",
    "original_who": "The Information",
    "original_day": "",
    "tier": "third_party_view"
   },
   {
