    "quote": "In September 2024, NVIDIA committed to purchasing all of CoreWeave’s unsold capacity through 2032 if CoreWeave failed to secure tenants, under a contract then valued at $6.3 billion.",
    "one_line": "In September 2024, NVIDIA committed to purchase CoreWeave’s unsold capacity through 2032 if CoreWeave failed to secure tenants; the contract was then valued at $6.3 billion.",
    "speaker": "moomoo.com, citing prior reporting by The Information",
